  "title": "Rhubarb Margarita",
  "description": "This rhubarb margarita, made in a blender with fresh rhubarb “juice”, sugar, ice, and tequila, is a fabulous sweet-tart combo — perfect on a hot day!",
  "authors": [
    "Jeannine Ross"
  ],
